      "created_at": "2014-02-22T15:51:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Apologies if others have said this. There's so much new content on the boards I haven't been able to get through it. Sentinel Tactics was released to playtesters yesterday. There are over 20 new threads in the playtest forums. I don't think we've seen this level of engagement before. The ranks of playtesters has swelled and there's a lot of excitement about the new game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I really don't mean this as a tease to those not in the playtest forums. I thought you'd at least be interested that playtesting has started, particularly as it may lead to less traffic in the other forums.</p>",
