    {
      "id": 93144,
      "name": "Ax_kidson",
      "username": "Ax_kidson",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ee59a6/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-25T22:07:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Apologies if others have said this. There's so much new content on the boards I haven't been able to get through it. Sentinel Tactics was released to playtesters yesterday. There are over 20 new threads in the playtest forums. I don't think we've seen this level of engagement before. The ranks of playtesters has swelled and there's a lot of excitement about the new game.&nbsp;I really don't mean this as a tease to those not in the playtest forums. I thought you'd at least be interested that playtesting has started, particularly as it may lead to less traffic in the other forums.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was going to say angry abusive things for pointing out that others don't get to join in … I only got the mailer about the new playtest window the day after it closed … so a bit of a sore spot…<br><br>but thank you for letting us know that playtesting has started … I know those that aren't in playtesting are very excited about Tactics<br><br>and we all hope you have heaps of fun and make it the best game it can be&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:19:17.320Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
