      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n\nApologies if others have said this. There&#39;s so much new content on the boards I haven&#39;t been able to get through it. Sentinel Tactics was released to playtesters yesterday. There are over 20 new threads in the playtest forums. I don&#39;t think we&#39;ve seen this level of engagement before. The ranks of playtesters has swelled and there&#39;s a lot of excitement about the new game.&nbsp;I really don&#39;t mean this as a tease to those not in the playtest forums. I thought you&#39;d at least be interested that playtesting has started, particularly as it may lead to less traffic in the other forums.\n\n[/quote]\nI was going to say angry abusive things for pointing out that others don&#39;t get to join in ... I only got the mailer about the new playtest window the day after it closed ... so a bit of a sore spot...<br /><br />but thank you for letting us know that playtesting has started ... I know those that aren&#39;t in playtesting are very excited about Tactics<br /><br />and we all hope you have heaps of fun and make it the best game it can be&nbsp;\n",
